  "title": "Chicken Shepherd's Pie",
  "description": "This is not your typical Shepherd 's Pie. Chicken takes the place of ground beef, a whole head of roasted garlic is mashed into the potatoes, and the thyme and rosemary add a perfect touch. And there 's lots of cheese.",
  "authors": [
